  "body": "I want to know about the peak performance of Mixed precision GEMM (Tensor Cores operate on FP16 input data with FP32 accumulation) for Ampere and Volta architecture with cutlass. Do we have any refrence of is it poosible to predeict it without performing an experiment (just by hardware spec)?\r\n\r\nI have a code for LU decomposition (mixed fp16 & fp 32), but I am seeing that it is slower with Ampere architecture vs. Volta. So I am looking to find the diference in Ampere whcih make my code to work slower. ",
